text = "A lot of bounty hunters have been wandering around the outskirts of Steemill recently (I wonder what's so valuable out there). We had a little \"skirmish\" with them (Hash won't be happy) and I managed to grab one of their dead bodies. I guess it's time for a little upgrade. Anyway, I found a really cool coat among trash arriving to Stemill. Must have belonged to someone important."
